[56.46, "o", "NAME: rancher\r\n"]
[56.58, "o", "LAST DEPLOYED: Mon Aug 31 10:12:28 2026\r\n"]
[56.7, "o", "NAMESPACE: cattle-system\r\n"]
[56.82, "o", "STATUS: deployed\r\n"]
[56.94, "o", "REVISION: 1\r\n"]
[57.06, "o", "TEST SUITE: None\r\n"]
[57.18, "o", "NOTES:\r\n"]
[57.3, "o", "Rancher Server has been installed. Rancher may take several minutes to fully initialize.\r\n"]
[57.42, "o", "Please standby while Certificates are being issued, Containers are started and the Ingress rule comes up.\r\n"]
[57.54, "o", "Check out our docs at https://rancher.com/docs/\r\n"]
[57.66, "o", "## First Time Login\r\n"]
[57.78, "o", "If you provided your own bootstrap password during installation, browse to https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal to get started.\r\n"]
[57.9, "o", "If this is the first time you installed Rancher, get started by running this command and clicking the URL it generates:\r\n"]
[58.02, "o", "```\r\n"]
[58.14, "o", "echo https://rancher.k3s.lab.internal/dashboard/?setup=$(kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}')\r\n"]
[58.26, "o", "```\r\n"]
[58.38, "o", "To get just the bootstrap password on its own, run:\r\n"]
[58.5, "o", "```\r\n"]
[58.62, "o", "kubectl get secret --namespace cattle-system bootstrap-secret -o go-template='{{.data.bootstrapPassword|base64decode}}{{ \"\\n\" }}'\r\n"]
[58.74, "o", "```\r\n"]
[58.86, "o", "Happy Containering!\r\n"]
